@startuml
' 实验二 用例图：活动票务与报名系统
' 四类角色各自的用例 + include/extend
' 说明1：未画系统边界框——图题已表明系统范围，且用例按角色分组排列，边界自明
' 说明2：布局为四层——左上组织者、右上平台管理员（两者同高），中间参与者，底部检票人员；
'        每个角色的用例贴着角色扇出，读图顺序即"治理在上、交易居中、现场垫底"
' 说明3：left to right 模式下方向提示整体旋转 90°：-down- 实际向右、-right- 实际向下、
'        -up- 实际向左、-left- 实际向上；下文锚点边均按此书写
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #4B5563
skinparam BorderColor #7C8AA0
skinparam TitleFontSize 19
skinparam TitleFontColor #334155
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FBF9F1
skinparam NoteBorderColor #D8D2BE
skinparam NoteFontSize 13
left to right direction
skinparam usecaseBackgroundColor #F2F5F9
skinparam usecaseBorderColor #7C8AA0
skinparam actorBorderColor #4B5563
skinparam actorBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam nodesep 30
skinparam ranksep 42

title 活动票务与报名系统 · 用例图

actor "组织者" as Organizer
usecase "提交演出申请" as UC_APPLY
usecase "申请改期或取消" as UC_CHANGE
usecase "查看统计并导出名单" as UC_STAT

actor "参与者" as Buyer
usecase "注册登录" as UC_REG
usecase "查询演出" as UC_SEARCH
usecase "购票" as UC_BUY
usecase "候补" as UC_WAIT
usecase "自助退票" as UC_REFUND

actor "检票人员" as Checker
usecase "核销票码" as UC_SCAN

actor "平台管理员" as Admin
usecase "审核演出申请" as UC_REVIEW
usecase "开启签到窗口" as UC_WINDOW
usecase "封禁账号" as UC_BAN
usecase "查询审计日志" as UC_AUDIT

usecase "实名认证" as UC_REAL
usecase "实名限购校验" as UC_LIMIT
usecase "校验签到窗口" as UC_WINCHK

Organizer -- UC_APPLY
Organizer -- UC_CHANGE
Organizer -- UC_STAT
Buyer -- UC_REG
Buyer -- UC_SEARCH
Buyer -- UC_BUY
Buyer -- UC_WAIT
Buyer -- UC_REFUND
Checker -- UC_SCAN
Admin -down- UC_REVIEW
Admin -down- UC_WINDOW
Admin -down- UC_BAN
Admin -down- UC_AUDIT

UC_REG ..> UC_REAL : <<include>>
UC_BUY ..> UC_LIMIT : <<include>>
UC_SCAN ..> UC_WINCHK : <<include>>
UC_WAIT ..> UC_BUY : <<extend>>

' 布局锚点（仅用于定位，不表达任何关系）：
' ① 两个角色间隐藏边固定左列从上到下的顺序：组织者 → 参与者 → 检票人员
Organizer -[hidden]right- Buyer
Buyer -[hidden]right- Checker
' ② 把平台管理员钉到顶部高度带（组织者首用例的右侧）
UC_APPLY -[hidden]down- Admin
' ③ 三条隐藏链把管理员的 4 个用例按业务顺序钉成其右侧一列（自上而下）
UC_REVIEW -[hidden]right- UC_WINDOW
UC_WINDOW -[hidden]right- UC_BAN
UC_BAN -[hidden]right- UC_AUDIT

note bottom of UC_WINCHK
  窗口未开启时核销应被拒绝
end note

@enduml
